---
globs: ["**/presentation/**/*.dart", "**/domain/**/*.dart", "assets/translations/**"]
description: Localization conventions using easy_localization
---
# Localization
- easy_localization with per-locale JSON files: assets/translations/en.json, assets/translations/ar.json — same key set in every locale file, no locale-specific extra keys
- no hardcoded user-facing strings anywhere in presentation code — every string goes through .tr()
- namespaced/nested keys matching feature structure, e.g. "auth.login.title", "auth.login.emailHint" — not flat generic keys like "title1"
- Failure/error messages carry a translation key (e.g. "errors.network.timeout"), not a hardcoded string — the key is resolved with .tr() only at the UI layer, never inside domain/data layers
- when adding a new string, add it to ALL locale JSON files at once, never just the default locale
- pluralization and interpolation use easy_localization's built-in plural/named-arg support, not manual string concatenation
- RTL: rely on easy_localization's locale-driven Directionality — don't manually force TextDirection anywhere
